# drained-events-archive

This file lists archived post_tool review events.

Each line is a JSON object written by `~/.jcode/bin/jcode-post-tool-review-queue`
when a `write|edit|apply_patch|multiedit` tool call succeeded in a watched cwd.

The coordinator's `~/.jcode/bin/jcode-drain-review-queue` rotates pending
events into timestamped files under `archive/` and forwards them to the
advisor swarm. Archives are kept for audit/forensics; old ones can be
pruned manually.
